WEBVTT

00:01.390 --> 00:05.760
Now, Misumi. The demons' surprise 
attack has left things in a poor state.

00:05.760 --> 00:08.980
I'm sending you to Limia. 
You will help the hero there.

00:09.560 --> 00:11.310
<i>I have a request for you two.</i>

00:11.310 --> 00:12.390
<i>Tomoe and Mio,</i>

00:12.390 --> 00:17.900
<i>I want you to lead adequately-trained 
highland orcs, mist lizards,</i>

00:17.900 --> 00:21.350
<i>and any other volunteers...</i>

00:22.070 --> 00:23.530
<i>and take Kaleneon.</i>

00:24.350 --> 00:26.290
<i>I'm counting on you two.</i>

00:49.150 --> 00:51.030
<b>Season Two</b>

02:02.100 --> 02:06.480
<b>Night Twenty-One    The Heroes Fight Bravely</b>

02:02.100 --> 02:06.480
<b>Night Twenty-One    The Heroes Fight Bravely</b>

02:02.670 --> 02:05.320
<i>On Misumi Makoto's orders,</i>

02:05.320 --> 02:06.930
<i>the denizens of the demiplane</i>

02:07.280 --> 02:10.800
<i>entered their first battle 
against the demons of Kaleneon.</i>

02:18.730 --> 02:21.120
The enemy's main forces have been routed!

02:21.120 --> 02:23.200
Switch to mopping them up!

02:28.280 --> 02:31.300
Well, well. You still intend to fight?

02:31.300 --> 02:36.210
Your attacks are completely 
ineffective against my reflection.

02:36.810 --> 02:41.190
At first I was disappointed, as I 
thought your size was just for show.

02:41.770 --> 02:45.470
I'm surprised you were analyzing my attacks.

02:46.410 --> 02:47.940
I offer you my compliments.

02:48.210 --> 02:50.110
I don't understand.

02:50.110 --> 02:53.010
Why do you keep using the same attacks?

02:53.010 --> 02:56.890
Because they were in the 
young master's memories.

02:57.480 --> 03:00.140
Walther and Smith & Wesson.

03:00.140 --> 03:03.040
Slashes that pierce even iron.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.990
I decided I'd only use those.

03:05.990 --> 03:09.300
I don't have a clue what 
you're talking about, but...

03:11.660 --> 03:14.610
If you mean to fight to the 
death, then I shall join you.

03:14.610 --> 03:16.760
I appreciate it.

03:33.720 --> 03:36.700
How truly interesting.

03:36.700 --> 03:40.880
But performing such complex 
calculations is a weakness.

03:43.290 --> 03:46.190
You're wasting your time, 
no matter how many times you try.

03:46.190 --> 03:49.120
Indeed. I'll never stop.

03:49.120 --> 03:52.740
Not even you can regenerate endlessly.

03:52.740 --> 03:56.050
I'll reflect your attacks dozens 
or even hundreds of times.

03:57.060 --> 03:58.630
Good luck with that.

03:58.630 --> 04:03.600
If you can withstand a few thousand more, 
perhaps you'll have a chance at victory.

04:11.640 --> 04:15.820
Mio's trying to master that 
reflection technique, isn't she?

04:15.820 --> 04:20.600
She's lucky. All I had to deal with were 
nobodies who hardly put up a fight.

04:20.600 --> 04:23.670
Our victory is as good as secured.

04:24.400 --> 04:26.350
This is a good opportunity.

04:27.800 --> 04:31.170
Perhaps I'll create an obvious border.

04:44.650 --> 04:46.090
That should do it.

04:48.290 --> 04:51.690
The demons won't be able to 
send reinforcements right away.

04:52.360 --> 04:56.510
They're too busy dealing 
with Limia and Gritonia.

04:58.090 --> 05:00.480
<i>A short time earlier,</i>

05:00.480 --> 05:04.050
<i>the demons approached the suburbs 
surrounding the imperial capital.</i>

05:04.050 --> 05:06.440
Demon forces spotted!

05:06.860 --> 05:08.750
Ready yourselves, shieldmen!

05:09.210 --> 05:11.210
Aim, archers!

05:11.870 --> 05:13.570
Fire!

05:13.880 --> 05:15.040
Well, well.

05:19.080 --> 05:20.630
It has begun.

05:21.590 --> 05:23.960
You snuck into a senior statesman's chamber

05:24.360 --> 05:27.670
smack dab in the middle of enemy forces?

05:28.170 --> 05:31.130
Rather bold of you, Rona.

05:31.530 --> 05:32.810
Sofia.

05:33.350 --> 05:36.340
I wish you'd share your information with us.

05:36.340 --> 05:39.760
We're your allies, not your subordinates.

05:39.760 --> 05:41.630
What have you learned?

05:42.120 --> 05:48.200
Iwahashi Tomoki, the empire's hero, 
fights differently by day and by night.

05:48.680 --> 05:53.790
I believe his healing only works 
when the moon is out at night.

05:54.140 --> 05:56.880
He only heals at night?

05:56.880 --> 05:57.630
Yes.

05:58.310 --> 06:02.450
But our true target is the hero of Limia.

06:02.450 --> 06:05.550
In other words, he's stronger at night.

06:05.910 --> 06:08.550
Are you listening?

06:08.550 --> 06:11.770
Rona, Princess Lily has returned.

06:12.290 --> 06:14.510
She's begun commanding the imperial forces.

06:14.510 --> 06:16.940
How did she get here from Rotsgard?

06:17.770 --> 06:19.970
Then we mustn't stay long.

06:19.970 --> 06:21.650
We should head to Fort Stella.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.310
You go on ahead.

06:24.170 --> 06:28.450
I'm going to go have some fun with the hero.

06:31.750 --> 06:33.580
Don't let them advance!

06:33.970 --> 06:35.870
Use all your firepower to rout them!

06:36.180 --> 06:37.330
Yes, sir!

06:41.910 --> 06:46.750
I'll think of this as practice for killing 
that sorcerer, and not hold back.

06:47.060 --> 06:51.960
The sorcerer, huh? 
I doubt you'd lose to him now.

06:58.130 --> 06:58.920
What is that?

07:01.100 --> 07:02.310
Good evening.

07:02.310 --> 07:02.950
Who are you?

07:03.280 --> 07:06.390
I'm Sofia. Sofia the Dragonslayer.

07:06.390 --> 07:09.820
Dragonslayer? You're Sofia Bulga.

07:09.820 --> 07:12.930
Oh, you know who I am?

07:12.930 --> 07:16.730
You're the hero of the 
empire, Iwahashi Tomoki.

07:16.730 --> 07:17.710
Y-Yeah.

07:17.710 --> 07:19.950
So, what do you want?

07:21.630 --> 07:23.360
I'm interested in you.

07:23.720 --> 07:25.730
What? In me?

07:27.120 --> 07:28.140
Watch out!

07:28.840 --> 07:30.680
Not a bad reaction.

07:30.680 --> 07:35.090
You disappoint me, Tomoki, 
but you've impressed me, lady knight.

07:39.690 --> 07:41.150
This smell...

07:41.150 --> 07:43.230
You've been granted strength 
by a greater dragon.

07:43.630 --> 07:46.680
Must be Glont, or Sazanami.

07:46.680 --> 07:49.620
Wh-What do you think you're 
doing, Sofia-dono?

07:49.620 --> 07:52.740
Oh, right. I hadn't mentioned it yet.

07:53.380 --> 07:56.700
I have another title these days.

07:56.700 --> 08:00.500
Sofia Bulga, Guest Commander of the Demons.

08:00.500 --> 08:01.940
The demons?

08:02.400 --> 08:06.460
I heard you're stronger at night, hero.

08:06.460 --> 08:09.960
Would you grant me a dance?

08:10.830 --> 08:13.470
No matter who you are...

08:13.470 --> 08:14.290
Don't bother.

08:14.750 --> 08:16.750
That won't work against me.

08:18.040 --> 08:20.590
<i>She knows about my Magic Eye...</i>

08:20.590 --> 08:24.600
Try beating me with that spear.

08:24.600 --> 08:27.930
If you can, I'll become yours.

08:28.200 --> 08:30.700
I'll offer you my body and mind.

08:31.130 --> 08:35.190
I'll show you that battles aren't 
determined by level alone!

08:35.190 --> 08:38.540
Oh, how marvelous. I agree completely.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.490
Then this lizard is in our way.

08:44.270 --> 08:45.030
Nagi!

08:48.970 --> 08:50.920
I'll be waiting for you below.

09:05.190 --> 09:07.180
Let's begin.

09:07.470 --> 09:10.640
If you lose, the empire 
will be in big trouble.

09:10.640 --> 09:12.420
Good luck.

09:12.420 --> 09:15.100
I'm a hero blessed with 
the goddess's protection.

09:15.680 --> 09:17.750
You may be the Dragonslayer, 
but don't underestimate me.

09:19.460 --> 09:23.330
Help me test my current strength.

09:27.490 --> 09:30.800
You fell for my Clay Doll Mad Trump!

09:32.740 --> 09:34.720
Nice work, Yukinatsu.

09:35.030 --> 09:37.080
That's an impressive spell.

09:37.080 --> 09:38.610
Isn't it exquisite?

09:38.610 --> 09:41.130
Breaking free of that 
binding won't be easy.

09:43.830 --> 09:45.550
You've put a lot of thought into this.

09:45.860 --> 09:48.360
Is that composure or arrogance?

09:48.360 --> 09:50.680
How well can you fight like that?

09:51.240 --> 09:53.110
Ginebia, stay on the defensive.

09:53.110 --> 09:54.440
Mora, you're with me.

09:54.440 --> 09:55.330
Yes, sir.

09:55.330 --> 09:58.040
You'll pay for what you did to Nagi!

09:58.040 --> 09:59.980
Hit me with your best shot.

10:00.660 --> 10:02.450
Like you're trying to kill me.

10:02.450 --> 10:05.090
Oh, yeah? In that case...

10:09.080 --> 10:11.550
I'll give you what you want!

10:11.880 --> 10:15.550
Die!

10:27.800 --> 10:31.950
If you had lived, I would've 
made you one of my women.

10:31.950 --> 10:33.530
What are you doing?

10:33.530 --> 10:36.910
Press me harder with more attacks.

10:38.370 --> 10:39.300
No way...

10:39.300 --> 10:41.310
But that was a direct hit.

10:41.730 --> 10:45.090
It was certainly an artistic attack.

10:45.920 --> 10:48.520
Despite combining so many elements,

10:48.520 --> 10:51.000
they don't interfere with each other's power.

10:52.030 --> 10:55.930
It's a shame, though. It wasn't 
strong enough to create a lake.

10:56.420 --> 11:00.330
Now, show me a hero's strength.

11:10.030 --> 11:15.610
I was once defeated by Sofia and injured 
in battle against the sorcerer...

11:29.000 --> 11:34.330
But I seem to have finally completely 
regained my power as a greater dragon.

11:37.300 --> 11:41.480
Honestly, what a letdown.

11:47.140 --> 11:49.770
You're a hero, aren't you?

11:49.770 --> 11:53.160
Stand up and fight!

12:04.070 --> 12:07.420
Huh? Your healing is as 
powerful as they say.

12:07.420 --> 12:09.630
You monster.

12:09.630 --> 12:14.500
Don't you think it's rude 
to call a woman a monster?

12:14.500 --> 12:16.380
Rude?

12:16.900 --> 12:20.830
Is that something a hyuman who 
sides with demons should say?

12:22.660 --> 12:28.860
Tomoki-kun, show me the strength of a hero.

12:28.860 --> 12:31.360
You're not done yet, are you?

12:31.360 --> 12:35.780
Or is there some kind of 
activation condition?

12:36.280 --> 12:41.470
Oh, are you worried about 
hitting them accidentally?

12:41.470 --> 12:43.210
Should I kill them first?

12:43.210 --> 12:47.890
Don't. If they die, I won't 
show you the ace up my sleeve.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.250
You want to see it, don't you?

12:50.250 --> 12:53.190
Then send my allies to 
the imperial capital.

12:53.980 --> 12:55.460
Fine, then.

12:55.460 --> 12:57.670
Mitsurugi, can you do that?

13:00.200 --> 13:01.800
That form...

13:02.400 --> 13:04.780
Your strength has finally returned.

13:04.780 --> 13:05.560
Yes.

13:06.200 --> 13:09.790
You want me to send those half-dead 
fools to the imperial capital?

13:13.520 --> 13:18.940
Now, show me the full power 
of the goddess's protection.

13:19.440 --> 13:23.730
Unfortunately, what I'm about to show 
you isn't the goddess's protection.

13:23.730 --> 13:24.660
Huh?

13:25.010 --> 13:27.950
It's your own fault things 
turned out this way.

13:27.950 --> 13:29.370
Prepare yourself.

13:29.790 --> 13:31.320
What's this?

13:31.660 --> 13:39.260
I'll show you the horrendous flames no 
one of this world could ever imagine!

13:40.700 --> 13:42.400
Obliterate!

14:01.540 --> 14:04.220
That was quite the trump card.

14:04.220 --> 14:04.860
Indeed.

14:05.380 --> 14:08.610
It was even more brutal 
than the sorcerer's arrow.

14:09.110 --> 14:11.570
I suppose I'd expect as much from a hero.

14:12.020 --> 14:15.080
It's a rough technique that 
consumes the caster's life.

14:15.580 --> 14:18.910
But that's not what makes 
it truly terrifying.

14:20.260 --> 14:29.070
Even those who avoid the direct blast are 
afflicted by a special poison or curse.

14:30.750 --> 14:31.980
We'll be fine.

14:33.220 --> 14:35.690
I hadn't realized I'd been affected, too.

14:36.240 --> 14:39.440
The hero himself seems to be unaffected.

14:39.440 --> 14:41.600
It's not a very heroic power.

14:42.130 --> 14:45.550
Now, let's reconnect telepathically.

14:45.550 --> 14:48.020
Oh, and don't touch the hero.

14:48.020 --> 14:49.540
I'm not killing him yet.

14:50.190 --> 14:52.290
<i>Rona, can you hear me?</i>

14:52.290 --> 14:54.990
<i>I sensed a tremendous blast of mana.</i>

14:54.990 --> 14:55.990
<i>What happened?</i>

14:56.300 --> 14:58.900
<i>Tomoki-kun's trump card.</i>

14:58.900 --> 15:02.470
<i>It was a high-power 
area-of-effect fire spell.</i>

15:02.470 --> 15:04.860
<i>So, did you kill him?</i>

15:04.860 --> 15:07.430
<i>No, sorry. He got away.</i>

15:07.430 --> 15:11.700
<i>I see. But if you got him to cast his 
trump card, that's good enough.</i>

15:12.130 --> 15:14.240
<i>Could you return to Fort Stella?</i>

15:14.240 --> 15:17.730
<i>Sure. I'm feeling pretty tired.</i>

15:17.730 --> 15:19.540
<i>I need a break.</i>

15:21.290 --> 15:22.340
<i>Sofia?</i>

15:22.970 --> 15:24.990
<i>Mitsurugi. You saw that, didn't you?</i>

15:25.310 --> 15:27.810
<i>She forgot to end the telepathic link.</i>

15:27.810 --> 15:29.640
<i>She seems rather flustered.</i>

15:29.960 --> 15:31.610
That's him.

15:31.610 --> 15:35.390
He's heading toward Limia's royal capital.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.920
You can fly, right?

15:36.920 --> 15:40.120
Yes. Let's go. We'll take him down.

15:40.870 --> 15:43.080
Today's the day I'll kill him.

15:43.080 --> 15:45.300
<i>You just wait, sorcerer.</i>

15:47.910 --> 15:52.720
<i>I wasn't expecting my greatest 
concern to appear in Limia.</i>

15:52.720 --> 15:54.510
<i>This is ridiculous.</i>

15:55.060 --> 15:57.480
<i>And now, back to the present.</i>

15:57.930 --> 16:00.940
<i>Misumi Makoto was heading 
to Limia's royal capital.</i>

16:01.510 --> 16:04.390
Something to hide yourself?

16:04.390 --> 16:08.510
Yeah. People can't know 
I'm the merchant Kuzunoha.

16:08.510 --> 16:13.830
You're right. I could probably return 
to my pre-contract form, but...

16:14.280 --> 16:16.000
Any ideas?

16:16.000 --> 16:19.960
I could wrap a cloth around myself, 
but it would probably come off in battle.

16:19.960 --> 16:23.370
Then we'll have to use that.

16:23.370 --> 16:27.380
I've been holding on to it since Mio-dono 
asked me to make improvements.

16:27.380 --> 16:28.030
What?

16:28.420 --> 16:30.550
You don't mean...

16:33.710 --> 16:35.290
Hibiki, it's no use.

16:35.730 --> 16:38.050
They've broken through the third 
and fourth defensive lines.

16:38.050 --> 16:40.860
I can't believe how easily 
they're getting through.

16:41.260 --> 16:45.120
This is why we should've moved the 
royal capital closer to the Hopleys' lands.

16:45.660 --> 16:49.360
It's a shame, since Ilumgand-dono 
was in favor of the transfer.

16:49.360 --> 16:54.480
Ilum-kun, huh? There's something happening 
in the academy city, too, isn't there?

16:54.480 --> 16:55.640
It seems that way.

16:55.640 --> 16:57.790
I hope he's all right.

16:57.790 --> 17:01.220
Either way, we'll have to retreat from here.

17:01.660 --> 17:07.270
Joining the forces sent to Stella and 
reclaiming the royal capital is our best move.

17:07.270 --> 17:10.080
Right. We should leave right away, Hibiki.

17:10.080 --> 17:14.710
W-Wait! If we flee, what will happen 
to the people in the city?

17:15.390 --> 17:16.840
Well...

17:20.370 --> 17:22.750
Chiya-chan, listen to me.

17:22.750 --> 17:24.490
O-Okay.

17:24.900 --> 17:30.900
Many lives have been lost already 
in battles against demons.

17:31.290 --> 17:36.420
We must carry their hopes with us.

17:37.810 --> 17:41.320
We will win this war and achieve peace.

17:41.650 --> 17:45.160
We must live so we can accomplish that.

17:45.550 --> 17:50.600
So we must endure everything, 
no matter how difficult it is.

17:53.310 --> 17:56.840
Are you talking about Naval?

18:00.470 --> 18:04.090
Yes. There's that, too... so...

18:04.090 --> 18:07.460
Seriously! You're still here?

18:07.460 --> 18:08.740
Sealy-san.

18:08.740 --> 18:10.490
This place is finished.

18:10.490 --> 18:13.550
Use the adventurers from 
Tsige to support a retreat.

18:13.550 --> 18:14.930
You can count on us.

18:15.260 --> 18:17.150
How is the evacuation 
of the citizens going?

18:17.570 --> 18:21.200
We're hoping for 30%. 50% won't happen.

18:21.200 --> 18:25.890
The demons are mowing down 
every hyuman they see.

18:26.870 --> 18:28.410
In any case, we must retreat.

18:28.410 --> 18:29.950
Do we have an escape route?

18:29.950 --> 18:31.270
Yes, in the throne—

18:33.610 --> 18:35.510
Impossible!

18:42.490 --> 18:48.150
Provide your enemies with an escape 
route, and most would take it.

18:52.300 --> 18:58.390
Or did you always intend to ambush 
me here, Hibiki the hero?

18:59.620 --> 19:01.190
Commander Io!

19:02.970 --> 19:07.760
That's an indecent outfit. 
Is it part of your strategy?

19:07.760 --> 19:10.910
It's enhancing garb made 
from my guardian beast.

19:10.910 --> 19:14.850
What do you think you're doing 
emerging from the ground like a mole?

19:15.570 --> 19:19.340
Our escape route lies beyond 
that collapsed passageway.

19:19.340 --> 19:20.510
Damn it.

19:21.560 --> 19:27.400
Waiting doesn't suit me, 
so I came to meet you.

19:27.400 --> 19:29.260
What about the soldiers outside?

19:29.590 --> 19:31.320
You're asking about them?

19:31.850 --> 19:35.740
You killed more of my allies!

19:35.740 --> 19:36.930
Miss!

19:36.930 --> 19:38.180
Stay calm, Hibiki!

19:38.180 --> 19:39.450
We must find another means of escape.

19:40.570 --> 19:43.850
You're still trying to flee? 
I don't think so.

19:44.440 --> 19:48.710
Hibiki, you will die here.

19:49.590 --> 19:52.910
If you flee, we'll slaughter 
everyone in the royal capital.

19:53.860 --> 19:56.880
Though it's a shameful thing 
for a warrior to do,

19:57.220 --> 20:00.140
I am currently a commander of demons.

20:00.140 --> 20:02.760
I am here as a soldier.

20:02.760 --> 20:05.620
You're saying soldiers slaughter civilians?

20:05.620 --> 20:09.010
This is a war between species.

20:09.010 --> 20:13.970
It will end with the extinction or 
eternal enslavement of one side.

20:13.970 --> 20:16.730
I know you sense that, as well.

20:18.300 --> 20:20.010
Now, make your decision.

20:20.010 --> 20:25.540
Will you sacrifice your people and flee 
or bet on your chances of killing me?

20:28.690 --> 20:34.390
<i>Incredible! This sword forged by 
Beren-san isn't just strong.</i>

20:34.390 --> 20:36.240
<i>It's enchanted with wind magic, as well!</i>

20:37.080 --> 20:38.160
Now, Hibiki!

20:38.450 --> 20:39.500
Take this!

20:45.860 --> 20:47.030
Is he dead?

21:02.260 --> 21:04.600
<i>Elemental gauntlets?</i>

21:04.600 --> 21:08.170
<i>Not only that, but they're enchanted 
with all four basic elements?</i>

21:08.440 --> 21:12.580
You're not the only ones 
with exceptional armaments.

21:12.580 --> 21:14.010
Now die!

21:14.570 --> 21:16.330
Hibiki!

21:24.790 --> 21:26.830
Who are you?

21:29.900 --> 21:36.300
<i>My only choice was to wear this hero suit 
Mio made in order to hide my appearance.</i>

21:38.330 --> 21:39.790
<i>What should I do now?</i>

21:39.790 --> 21:41.050
<i>My out-of-place outfit has</i>

21:41.050 --> 21:42.230
<i>struck them all speechless.</i>

21:45.140 --> 21:46.010
<i>Huh?</i>

21:47.800 --> 21:50.610
<i>No way. You're kidding, right?</i>

21:58.400 --> 22:01.380
<i>Otonashi-senpai is a hero?</i>

23:35.330 --> 23:37.100
<i>Night Twenty-Two:</i>

23:35.510 --> 23:40.310
<b>Next Time</b>

23:37.100 --> 23:38.980
<i>"Fight On, Hero!"</i>

23:37.100 --> 23:40.310
<b>Fight On, Hero!</b>
